        "answer": {
          "short": "$15x^2(x^3-1)^4$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}(x^3-1)^5&=5(x^3-1)^4\\cdot3x^2\\\\&=15x^2(x^3-1)^4\\end{aligned}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
