        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{(x^3-1)^5}{5}+C$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\int3x^2(x^3-1)^4\\,dx&=\\frac15\\int15x^2(x^3-1)^4\\,dx\\\\&=\\frac{(x^3-1)^5}{5}+C\\end{aligned}$$",
